MYTHIC_TILES (tilesets/mythic_tiles.png)

Custom tileset shared by all maps of this repository. It contains:

- Team logo (rows 1-2 and 6-8): property of its owner.
- Arcade cabinets (row 53, columns 7-8): drawn for this map, same license as the map (LICENSE.map).
- "Magic: The Gathering" logo paintings (rows 1-5, columns 3-8): Magic: The Gathering and its logos
  are trademarks of Wizards of the Coast LLC. They are NOT covered by the licenses of this repository.
- Office furniture (rows 9-54): from the LPC Revised project, https://github.com/ElizaWy/LPC
  (also https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-revised-the-office)
    * Desk (Office), Cabinet, Lighting (Floor): Lanea Zimmerman (Sharm) and Eliza Wyatt (DeathsDarling)
      Base assets: https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-modified-base-tiles
                   https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-interior-castle-tiles
    * Planter: Lanea Zimmerman (Sharm), recolored by Eliza Wyatt
      Base assets: https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-interior-castle-tiles
    * Bin, Copy Machine, Shelf, Tables (Card), TV (Widescreen), Chair (Office), Coffee Maker,
      Laptop, Rotary Phone: Eliza Wyatt (DeathsDarling)
  License: OGA-BY 3.0 (https://opengameart.org/content/oga-by-30-faq), a CC-BY 3.0 based license.
  The TV sheet was cropped to its first two screens; other sheets are unmodified.
